#                validation cannot: a stack where half the classes state a
#                seniority is not an invalid row anywhere, and is the usual
#                reason a waterfall pays out in an order nobody intended. Where
#                the conversion target is ambiguous no arrow is drawn — an
#                arrow to a guess reads as a fact. Hand-rolled SVG, because the
#                server already decided the ranks and a force-directed layout
